{"term": {"label": "愛", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-ii", "title": "離婁下", "description": "孟子曰：「舜生於諸馮，遷於負夏，卒於鳴條，東夷之人也。文王生於岐周，卒於畢郢，西夷之人也。地之相去也，千有餘里；世之相後也，千有餘歲。得志行乎中國，若合符節。先聖後聖，其揆一也。」\n子產聽鄭國之政，以其乘輿濟人於溱洧。孟子曰：「惠而不知為政。歲十一月徒杠成，十二月輿梁成，民未病涉也。君子平其政，行辟人可也。焉得人人而濟", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "傷", "id": "傷"}, {"form": "出", "id": "出"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "同", "id": "同"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "存", "id": "存"}, {"form": "室", "id": "室"}, {"form": "從", "id": "從"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "愛", "variants": [], "id": "愛"}, {"form": "憂", "id": "憂"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "敬", "id": "敬"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "異", "id": "異"}, {"form": "禽獸", "id": "禽獸"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "賢", "id": "賢"}, {"form": "過", "id": "過"}, {"form": "鬭", "id": "鬭"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.6164133863285559, "source": "賢", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 0.6164133863285559, "source": "人", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 2.0027077474484467, "source": "人", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 0.6164133863285559, "source": "人", "target": "出"}, {"weight": 1.1554098870612428, "source": "人", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 2.0027077474484467, "source": "人", "target": "異"}, {"weight": 2.0027077474484467, "source": "人", "target": "禽獸"}, {"weight": 2.0027077474484467, "source": "人", "target": "過"}, {"weight": 0.6164133863285559, "source": "人", "target": "存"}, {"weight": 0.2109482782203915, "source": "人", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 0.2109482782203915, "source": "人", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.0027077474484467, "source": "人", "target": "愛"}, {"weight": 1.597242639340282, "source": "人", "target": "敬"}, {"weight": 1.309560566888501, "source": "人", "target": "憂"}, {"weight": 1.